    "usage_percent_available": false,
    "usage_percent_note": "The site publishes a usage RANK per Pokemon but no species usage percent. Percentages are shares within one Pokemon: the ten listed moves sum to 382-398 percent (a set has four moves, so all moves together make 400), the listed items, abilities and natures to about 100 percent, but the ten listed stat point spreads cover only 28 (Incineroar) to 75 (Indeedee-F) percent, so spreads are dispersed",
    "marginals_note": "All lists are marginal distributions; the site does not publish which move, item and spread occur together in one set",
    "partner_percent_note": "Partners are published as an ordered top 10 only; the percentage field of the data is 0 for every partner",
    "names_note": "The data files use Japanese names; the English names here are the ones the English page renders",
    "stat_points_note": "The page calls them EVs: HP/Atk/Def/SpA/SpD/Spe points, at most 32 each and 66 in total, which are the Champions stat points"
